  "safety_rules": [
    "G1 validators and planning only, no socket/OS/capture/PDF/monitor side effects.",
    "Registry default != execution; startup initializes zero optional modules.",
    "Unselected feature SKIPPED_BY_USER, unavailable dependency/permission UNAVAILABLE; local errors ERROR.",
    "Prerequisite collectors may be shared once internally, but never execute a deselected diagnostic probe; dependencies must not auto-consent capture.",
    "Presets cannot grant capture consent. Restore profile strips capture_approved and all HIGH-cost/risky optional selections until reconfirmed.",
    "SOCKET success/refusal is OS observation only; never assert observed SYN/RST or a blocking device without PACKET/device evidence.",
    "OBSERVED requires resolvable evidence; synthetic fixture evidence must remain labelled synthetic and never be advertised as measured.",
    "Legacy1.0 conversion preserves raw input separately, missing fields UNKNOWN/null, no invented PASS/evidence/counters.",
    "G0 safe dev baseline: x64 current Win10 test host only verified; Win11/Server2016+ support unverified; no Npcap redistribution/install; default masking ON; offline only; unsigned local dev build only."
  ]
